  abilityDesc: 8 combo powerful Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), massive Thunder attack on single foe (consecutive uses boost damage), considerably
    boosts own Atk, Def and enormously boosts own critical hit rate for 3 turns,
    probable, considerably boosts own Spark damage for 3 turns & boosts OD gauge
